rget=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557573603_e98a9df4ec_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r84PSK\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S flava \"Huge Lid, Heavy Veins Turning Red\" x \"Heavy Veins\"</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/>This seedling got all the height and color:<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r7Y5vy\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54556452162_bff3149162_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r7Y5vy\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. (oreophila x \"Don's Red Tube\") C x (oreophila x \"Blood Moon\") B</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/>This one just got fat<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r85iSj\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557667770_3a137d5536_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r85iSj\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. (oreophila x \"Don's Red Tube\") C x (oreophila x \"Blood Moon\") B</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r83zDj\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557330616_48d6f3730e_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r83zDj\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. \"flava ornata\" x (('leah Wilkerson' x oreophila) x \"Bengal Tiger\"</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r84xnS\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557518104_299a7d5481_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r84xnS\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. flava ornata x cuprea ICPS</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r7Y5nN\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54556451712_6888921b9d_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r7Y5nN\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. flava ornata x cuprea ICPS</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/>Some of the few adult plants that didn't give a damn over winter<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r85iP8\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557667585_ec66f054c4_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r85iP8\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. oreophila \"North Sound\" x purpurea \"Giant #1\" HC D</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r85j39\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557668340_ab894e54a7_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r85j39\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. 'Eric Green's OP Mix\"</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r7Y5Hx\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54556452857_263f8d1932_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r7Y5Hx\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. 'Cyclops' x 'Edojiman'</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r83zPu\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557331206_bd87869552_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r83zPu\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. flava Virginia</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/>Lost my Black veins plants, but this ornata still lives...not quite ornate just yet though<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r84Q2s\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557574108_ddc5a92e12_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r84Q2s\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. flava \"ornata, Improved\"</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/> More seedlings<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r7Y5Fi\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54556452727_e025325317_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r7Y5Fi\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. ((x swaniana x 'Scarlet Belle') x oreophila) x \"Lunch Box\"</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r83zLJ\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557331046_09e8b1ef4d_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r83zLJ\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. 'Red Sumatra' OP x flava cuprea</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r83zLD\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54557331041_c931bfeb0e_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2r83zLD\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. 'Red Sumatra' OP x flava cuprea</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/>",
